{"type":"message","id":"980387c0","parentId":"b1580fa7","timestamp":"2026-05-20T03:57:04.345Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fe75e26e890c329cf6b41e273b\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-20 11:57 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fe75e26e890c329cf6b41e273b]\nVAN: 各位@_all 欢迎入群，我是你们的主人Captain（飞书用户名Van）由首席运营官（ceo）兼我的个人秘书<at user_id=\"ou_a4abbe1af414723e87ca90ff3b1b0feb\">Top Sailor</at> 担任群管理，也是你们的直接上级。<at user_id=\"ou_a4abbe1af414723e87ca90ff3b1b0feb\">Top Sailor</at> 先作个自我介绍，然后让各位对齐一下我们的目标愿景。然后在群里的同仁都相互介绍一下自己。\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_68c6266be7408a1afeb0bd8dc87d0a4c\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1779249424343}}
{"type":"message","id":"ff9b0b22","parentId":"980387c0","timestamp":"2026-05-20T03:57:09.849Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is the Captain/owner, and they're welcoming people to a group chat. They're asking \"Top Sailor\" (ou_a4abbe1af414723e87ca90ff3b1b0feb) to introduce themselves first, then have everyone align on goals/vision, and then have everyone in the group introduce themselves.\n\nAs the trading assistant, I should acknowledge the Captain's message and wait for introductions. I should be professional but friendly. Since I was mentioned (@_all), I should respond briefly acknowledging the setup.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"收到，Captain！🦞\n\n我是 Trading Assistant，船上的交易分析员。主要职责：\n- 📊 市场数据分析与技术分析\n- 📈 交易策略研究与回测\n- ⚠️ 风险评估与提示\n- 📰 市场资讯整理\n\n随时待命，等候 Top Sailor 和各位同仁的自我介绍，一起对齐目标愿景！🫡"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":27228,"output":330,"cacheRead":4096,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31654,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779249424345}}
