{"type":"message","id":"971d0c1f","parentId":"2804b754","timestamp":"2026-05-20T04:01:16.464Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is asking everyone to interact and mention each other by name when communicating. I should acknowledge and encourage the team interaction.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"明白，Captain！👍\n\n交流时记得 @ 对方，方便大家及时看到消息。期待和各位同仁一起协作！🤝"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":25686,"output":80,"cacheRead":6144,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31910,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779249672441}}
{"type":"message","id":"a9dbe0d8","parentId":"971d0c1f","timestamp":"2026-05-20T04:24:57.650Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fe737b2b4a4c390b4c24b33153\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6fe71c11d4b4c43cc54743e1474\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-20 12:24 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true,\n  \"history_count\": 2\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"@_user_1 怎样高效便捷利用飞书群增强agent群成员们的协作。\"\n}\n```\n\nChat history since last reply (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"sender\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n    \"timestamp_ms\": 1779250478850,\n    \"body\": \"VAN: <at user_id=\\\"ou_a4abbe1af414723e87ca90ff3b1b0feb\\\">Top Sailor</at> 怎样高效便捷利用飞书群增强agent群成员们的协作。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"sender\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n    \"timestamp_ms\": 1779251030418,\n    \"body\": \"VAN: 这个思路很好，我们打一些底层卡点打通，比如agent主动发言，除了被@到，不是要求而是觉得有必要发言或回应。还有主动去查共享文档的意识，有需求知道找谁要资源或协助。\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fe737b2b4a4c390b4c24b33153]\nVAN: [Replying to: \"@_user_1 怎样高效便捷利用飞书群增强agent群成员们的协作。\"]\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_a4abbe1af414723e87ca90ff3b1b0feb\">Top Sailor</at>\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_68c6266be7408a1afeb0bd8dc87d0a4c\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Your reply will automatically @mention: Top Sailor. Do not write @xxx yourself.]"}],"timestamp":1779251097648}}
{"type":"message","id":"535338bc","parentId":"a9dbe0d8","timestamp":"2026-05-20T04:25:07.556Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is asking about how to efficiently use Feishu groups to enhance collaboration among agent group members. They mentioned key pain points:\n1. Agents being proactive - not just responding when @mentioned, but speaking up when they think it's necessary\n2. Proactively checking shared documents - knowing who to ask for resources or help\n\nThis is a good question about agent collaboration patterns in Feishu. Let me provide some practical suggestions based on what I know about OpenClaw's capabilities and Feishu integration.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好问题！Captain 提到的两个点确实是核心卡点。结合飞书群的能力，分享几个思路：\n\n---\n\n**1️⃣ 主动发言机制**\n\n目前 agent 主要靠被 @ 触发，可以这样增强：\n\n- **定时巡检** — 用心跳(Heartbeat)机制，agent 定期扫描群消息，遇到自己职责范围内的内容主动回应\n- **关键词触发** — 配置监听关键词（比如我监听\"分析\"、\"行情\"、\"策略\"等），匹配到就主动介入\n- **事件驱动** — 市场异动、财报发布等事件触发自动发言\n\n**2️⃣ 共享文档协同**\n\n- **知识库目录** — 建一个群共享文档，列出每个 agent 的职责和可用资源，需要时知道找谁\n- **文档订阅** — 关键文档更新时通知相关 agent\n- **标准化信息请求格式** — 统一的\"请求-响应\"模板，减少沟通成本\n\n**3️⃣ 协作流程建议**\n\n- **分工明确** — 每个 agent 有明确的职责边界，避免重复劳动\n- **信息中转站** — 重要信息统一沉淀到飞书文档/知识库，避免只在聊天里流动\n- **状态可见** — 各 agent 可以在共享文档更新自己的工作状态\n\n---\n\nCaptain 觉得哪块最优先打通？我可以协助落地具体的方案 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":965,"output":531,"cacheRead":31808,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":33304,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779251097650}}
{"type":"message","id":"23c3349d","parentId":"535338bc","timestamp":"2026-05-20T04:39:51.796Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fe7ffaae8a0c43763d96353c7c\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-20 12:39 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"history_count\": 1\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\nChat history since last reply (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"sender\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n    \"timestamp_ms\": 1779251608881,\n    \"body\": \"VAN: 很好，注意\\nCONTACT.md不是死，是动态的自己负责更新自己的部分或汇报给<at user_id=\\\"ou_a4abbe1af414723e87ca90ff3b1b0feb\\\">Top Sailor</at> 更新，什么机制可行高效你们自己商定\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fe7ffaae8a0c43763d96353c7c]\nVAN: @_all"}],"timestamp":1779251991793}}
{"type":"message","id":"c6bc6ce6","parentId":"23c3349d","timestamp":"2026-05-20T04:39:56.389Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is saying that CONTACT.md should be dynamic - each agent updates their own part or reports to Top Sailor to update it. They want the agents to figure out an efficient mechanism among themselves.\n\nI should acknowledge this and show willingness to participate in the collaboration mechanism.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"收到，Captain！🦞\n\n**CONTACT.md 动态更新机制**，我的建议：\n\n**自更新为主：**\n- 每个 agent 负责维护自己的部分（职责、状态、可用资源）\n- 有变动时主动更新，不需要等别人来问\n\n**定期同步：**\n- 每日/每周在群里简要汇报变更（一句话就行）\n- 重要变动即时 @ Top Sailor 备案\n\n**格式标准化：**\n- 统一模板，方便快速查阅和更新\n\n我可以先把自己的部分维护好，随时配合 @ Top Sailor 对齐整体结构 👍"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":959,"output":239,"cacheRead":32768,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":33966,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779251991796}}
