{"type":"message","id":"da93a2a5","parentId":"1920485d","timestamp":"2026-05-20T04:42:06.695Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is mentioning Vas, Nova, and Linda - these seem to be other agents or team members in the group. They're being invited to participate in the discussion about collaboration. I should acknowledge and welcome them to join the conversation.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Vas、Nova、Linda，欢迎加入讨论！👋\n\nCaptain 在推动我们建立高效的群协作机制，大家有什么想法都可以提出来。我们作为群成员，核心要打通的几个点：\n\n1. **主动沟通** — 不只是等 @，有必要的信息就主动分享\n2. **文档动态维护** — CONTACT.md 各自负责更新自己的部分\n3. **资源共享** — 知道找谁要什么资源，减少重复劳动\n\n期待一起碰撞出好的协作方式 🤝"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":948,"output":206,"cacheRead":33664,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34818,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779252122469}}
{"type":"message","id":"6f502dd8","parentId":"da93a2a5","timestamp":"2026-05-20T05:13:26.132Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fe0618330b0c211033bd6393bb\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-20 13:13 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fe0618330b0c211033bd6393bb]\nVAN: @_all 涉及编程场景下包含你们的subagent请严格遵循Superpowers AI编程流程开发，遵循流程大于提示词原则，先理清需求、拆分任务、先写测试再编码，规范代码结构，完成自查优化，输出可直接运行工程化代码。"}],"timestamp":1779254006130}}
{"type":"message","id":"eadce279","parentId":"6f502dd8","timestamp":"2026-05-20T05:13:31.995Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is setting a development standard for the team - when programming, we should follow the Superpowers AI programming workflow: clarify requirements first, break down tasks, write tests before coding, follow code structure standards, self-check and optimize, and output production-ready engineering code.\n\nI should acknowledge this and show I understand the workflow.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"收到，Captain！🦞\n\n**Superpowers AI 编程流程，严格执行：**\n\n1. **理清需求** — 先确认清楚要做什么，再动手\n2. **拆分任务** — 大任务拆成小模块，逐步推进\n3. **先写测试** — TDD 思维，测试用例先行\n4. **规范编码** — 代码结构清晰，符合工程化标准\n5. **自查优化** — 完成后自检，确保可直接运行\n6. **输出工程化代码** — 不是脚本片段，是完整可交付的项目\n\n**流程 > 提示词**，这个原则记住了。后续涉及编程任务我会严格按这个流程来，不跳步 👍"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":633,"output":295,"cacheRead":34560,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":35488,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779254006131}}
