{"type":"message","id":"cd8e8f47","parentId":"d6590113","timestamp":"2026-05-20T05:34:02.717Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The error says \"File not in msg.\" - the file might not be in that specific message. Let me try to find the correct message ID. Looking at the conversation history, the file was shared in message \"om_x100b6fe038a280a4c23bd06b0ac5e08\" but the file might have been in a different message.\n\nActually, looking back at the chat history, the file was shared in the message before the current one. The message that contained the file was:\n```\n\"body\": \"VAN: {\\\"file_key\\\":\\\"file_v3_0011s_e9f3d07c-08a4-4494-803e-f7b842d3752g\\\",\\\"file_name\\\":\\\"chanlun_mvp_roadmap.md\\\"}\"\n\n\n```\n\nThe message_id from the context is \"om_x100b6fe038a280a4c23bd06b0ac5e08\", but the file was actually shared in the chat history entry with timestamp 1779255052613. I need to look more carefully at the message structure - the file data appears to be in the body field of that earlier message.\n\n```","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_75eecdda495b402894cd1019","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'EOF'\nimport json, requests\n\nwith open('/workspace/projects/openclaw.json') as f:\n    config = json.load(f)\n\nfeishu = config['channels']['feishu']\napp_id = feishu['appId']\napp_secret = feishu['appSecret']\n\n# Get tenant access token\ntoken_resp = requests.post('https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal', json={\n    'app_id': app_id,\n    'app_secret': app_secret\n})\naccess_token = token_resp.json()['tenant_access_token']\nheaders = {'Authorization': f'Bearer {access_token}'}\n\n# List recent messages in the chat to find the file message\nchat_id = \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\"\nresp = requests.get(\n    f'https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/messages',\n    headers=headers,\n    params={'container_id_type': 'chat', 'container_id': chat_id, 'page_size': 20}\n)\n\ndata = resp.json()\nif data.get('code') == 0:\n    items = data.get('data', {}).get('items', [])\n    for msg in items:\n        msg_type = msg.get('msg_type', '')\n        msg_id = msg.get('message_id', '')\n        body = msg.get('body', {}).get('content', '')\n        if 'file' in body.lower() or 'roadmap' in body.lower():\n            print(f\"Found: {msg_id} | type: {msg_type}\")\n            print(f\"Body: {body[:500]}\")\n            print(\"---\")\nelse:\n    print(\"Error:\", data)\nEOF","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":837,"output":973,"cacheRead":41600,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43410,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779255231541}}
