{"type":"message","id":"97002b96","parentId":"75895eeb","timestamp":"2026-05-20T05:34:16.640Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK, I can see the messages in the chat. The file message \"om_x100b5414051a20a0c2ed7d27768c101\" was recalled (recalled). So the file was recalled by the sender.\n\nLooking at the most recent messages, I can see the group context now. The file \"chanlun_mvp_roadmap.md\" was shared but the message was recalled. So the file is no longer accessible.\n\nBut VAN's latest message (the one I'm responding to) says \"讨论方案\" - they want to discuss the plan. Since the file was recalled, I should let Captain know that the file was recalled and ask them to re-share it.\n\n\nI notice the file message shows as recalled in the Feishu messages, so I need to let Captain know it's no longer available and ask them to share it again.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Captain，我查了一下群消息记录——那个 `chanlun_mvp_roadmap.md` 文件消息已经被撤回了，现在无法下载 😅\n\n能否重新发一下？或者直接把内容贴到群里/飞书文档里给我链接，我马上分析讨论 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":4428,"output":448,"cacheRead":43136,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48012,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779255249894}}
{"type":"message","id":"3de1e08c","parentId":"97002b96","timestamp":"2026-05-20T05:36:34.283Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fe0c8ddb4b0c3663109bf2a6c2\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6fe038a280a4c23bd06b0ac5e08\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-20 13:36 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true,\n  \"history_count\": 1\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"@_user_1 自己想办法解决，马上\"\n}\n```\n\nChat history since last reply (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"sender\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n    \"timestamp_ms\": 1779255335773,\n    \"body\": \"VAN: 没有啊，一直在啊\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fe0c8ddb4b0c3663109bf2a6c2]\nVAN: [Replying to: \"@_user_1 自己想办法解决，马上\"]\n\n\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_68c6266be7408a1afeb0bd8dc87d0a4c\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1779255394280}}
{"type":"message","id":"ec3ce3b0","parentId":"3de1e08c","timestamp":"2026-05-20T05:36:44.798Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN says the file is still there and hasn't been recalled. Let me try again to download it. Maybe my previous API call was using the wrong message_id. Let me look at the messages again more carefully and find the file message.\n\nLooking at the messages I listed, I see:\n- `om_x100b5414051a20a0c2ed7d27768c101 | file | This message was recalled`\n\nBut VAN says it's still there. Maybe the API is showing it as recalled to the bot but it's visible to users. Or maybe there's a different file message.\n\nLet me search more carefully for file messages in the chat. The file_key was \"file_v3_0011s_e9f3d07c-08a4-4494-803e-f7b842d3752g\". \n\nI should try a different approach and query the Feishu API directly for file messages, or attempt to download using the file_key I have.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b20e7b81eaa9496b87874aec","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'EOF'\nimport json, requests\n\nwith open('/workspace/projects/openclaw.json') as f:\n    config = json.load(f)\n\nfeishu = config['channels']['feishu']\napp_id = feishu['appId']\napp_secret = feishu['appSecret']\n\ntoken_resp = requests.post('https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal', json={\n    'app_id': app_id,\n    'app_secret': app_secret\n})\naccess_token = token_resp.json()['tenant_access_token']\nheaders = {'Authorization': f'Bearer {access_token}'}\n\nchat_id = \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\"\n\n# Get ALL messages and find file type\nresp = requests.get(\n    f'https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/messages',\n    headers=headers,\n    params={'container_id_type': 'chat', 'container_id': chat_id, 'page_size': 50}\n)\n\ndata = resp.json()\nif data.get('code') == 0:\n    items = data.get('data', {}).get('items', [])\n    for msg in items:\n        msg_type = msg.get('msg_type', '')\n        msg_id = msg.get('message_id', '')\n        body = msg.get('body', {}).get('content', '')\n        if msg_type == 'file' or 'file_key' in body:\n            print(f\"FILE MSG: {msg_id} | type: {msg_type}\")\n            print(f\"Body: {body}\")\n            print(f\"Sender: {msg.get('sender',{}).get('id','')}\")\n            print(\"---\")\n    \n    # Also check for the specific file_key\n    print(\"\\nSearching for file_key in all messages...\")\n    for msg in items:\n        body = msg.get('body', {}).get('content', '')\n        if 'file_v3_0011s' in body:\n            print(f\"FOUND: {msg.get('message_id')}\")\n            print(f\"Body: {body}\")\nEOF","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":908,"output":938,"cacheRead":47552,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49398,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779255394282}}
