{"type":"message","id":"2ebe1408","parentId":"43cf6165","timestamp":"2026-05-20T06:12:23.778Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is replying to an Interactive Card message, but there's no text content in their message. The replied message is just \"[Interactive Card]\" which means it was a card message. VAN might be asking me to respond to or interact with the card, or they might be waiting for something.\n\nSince there's no actual text content from VAN, and the replied message is just an interactive card reference, I should ask what they need or acknowledge if there's something specific they want me to do.\n\nActually, looking at the context more carefully - VAN replied to an interactive card with no text. This could mean they're just acknowledging it, or they want me to see it. Since I can't see the card content, I should just acknowledge and ask if there's something specific they need.\n\n\nI'll keep this brief and ask directly what they're looking for.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Captain，看到了一个交互卡片的回复，但具体内容我这边看不到。需要我做什么吗？🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1305,"output":371,"cacheRead":59392,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":61068,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779257537594}}
