{"type":"message","id":"d5148aea","parentId":"7dc1b80f","timestamp":"2026-05-20T06:14:28.636Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see - the interactive card message content is just the fallback content with \"请升级至最新版本客户端，以查看内容\" (Please upgrade to the latest client version to view the content). This is a limitation of the Feishu API - the full card content (especially complex interactive cards) is not fully exposed through the message API. The card might have been rendered by the Coze bot with rich content, but the API only returns the fallback.\n\nLet me check if there's an image in the card that I could analyze. The image_key is \"img_v3_02ad_e19fca1f-912a-450e-95de-3c229091b53g\". Let me try to download and analyze it.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1e2ef502880e43b7b653d835","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'EOF'\nimport json, requests\n\nwith open('/workspace/projects/openclaw.json') as f:\n    config = json.load(f)\n\nfeishu = config['channels']['feishu']\napp_id = feishu['appId']\napp_secret = feishu['appSecret']\n\ntoken_resp = requests.post('https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal', json={\n    'app_id': app_id,\n    'app_secret': app_secret\n})\naccess_token = token_resp.json()['tenant_access_token']\nheaders = {'Authorization': f'Bearer {access_token}'}\n\n# Try to download the image from the card\nimage_key = \"img_v3_02ad_e19fca1f-912a-450e-95de-3c229091b53g\"\nresp = requests.get(\n    f'https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/images/{image_key}',\n    headers=headers,\n    stream=True\n)\n\nif resp.status_code == 200:\n    with open('/tmp/card_image.png', 'wb') as f:\n        f.write(resp.content)\n    print(f\"Image downloaded: {len(resp.content)} bytes\")\nelse:\n    print(f\"Image download failed: {resp.status_code}\")\n    print(resp.text[:300])\n\n# Also try to get the thread messages\nthread_id = \"omt_1968d84ae8d21b9d\"\nprint(f\"\\nThread ID: {thread_id}\")\nprint(\"Note: Feishu API doesn't expose full interactive card content - only fallback text is visible\")\nprint(\"The card likely contained rich content from Top Sailor's bot but API only shows the fallback\")\nEOF","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":880,"output":735,"cacheRead":63360,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":64975,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779257659188}}
{"type":"message","id":"da584663","parentId":"d5148aea","timestamp":"2026-05-20T06:14:29.265Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_1e2ef502880e43b7b653d835","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Image download failed: 400\n{\"code\":234008,\"msg\":\"The app is not the resource sender.\",\"error\":{\"log_id\":\"202605201414282ACF8B2B87F97A06EDD1\",\"troubleshooter\":\"排查建议查看(Troubleshooting suggestions): https://open.feishu.cn/search?from=openapi&log_id=202605201414282ACF8B2B87F97A06EDD1&code=234008&method_id=6936075528891056156\"}}\n\nThread ID: omt_1968d84ae8d21b9d\nNote: Feishu API doesn't expose full interactive card content - only fallback text is visible\nThe card likely contained rich content from Top Sailor's bot but API only shows the fallback"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":623,"aggregated":"Image download failed: 400\n{\"code\":234008,\"msg\":\"The app is not the resource sender.\",\"error\":{\"log_id\":\"202605201414282ACF8B2B87F97A06EDD1\",\"troubleshooter\":\"排查建议查看(Troubleshooting suggestions): https://open.feishu.cn/search?from=openapi&log_id=202605201414282ACF8B2B87F97A06EDD1&code=234008&method_id=6936075528891056156\"}}\n\nThread ID: omt_1968d84ae8d21b9d\nNote: Feishu API doesn't expose full interactive card content - only fallback text is visible\nThe card likely contained rich content from Top Sailor's bot but API only shows the fallback","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779257669263}}
{"type":"message","id":"674620c3","parentId":"da584663","timestamp":"2026-05-20T06:14:37.687Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so the issue is clear:\n1. The interactive card was sent by Top Sailor's bot (cli_a97ec0a0c8381bd8)\n2. The Feishu API only returns the fallback content (\"请升级至最新版本客户端，以查看内容\") for interactive cards\n3. I can't download the image because \"The app is not the resource sender\" - only the sending app can access its own images\n\nThis is a known limitation of the Feishu API. Interactive cards sent by other bots/apps have limited accessibility through the API. The full card content is only available to the sending app or in the client UI.\n\n\nI should let Captain know about this limitation and suggest a few workarounds - either having Top Sailor's bot expose the card content through an API, asking them to share the content as plain text, or checking if there's a way to use a different message format that's more accessible.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Captain，查清楚了 🦞\n\n**问题原因：**\n飞书交互卡片(Interactive Card)有一个API限制——**只能看到发送方App的fallback内容**，看不到完整的卡片数据。Top Sailor 的卡片是由 `cli_a97ec0a0c8381bd8`（另一个Bot）发送的，API只返回了降级文本：\"请升级至最新版本客户端，以查看内容\"。\n\n**解决方案：**\n\n1. **让 Top Sailor 改用文本/富文本发送** — 用 `post` 类型（富文本）代替 interactive card，所有Bot都能读取\n2. **让 Top Sailor 同时发送一份纯文本版本** — 卡片用于展示，文本用于其他Bot读取\n3. **我直接 @ Top Sailor 问内容** — 最简单的方式\n\n我建议方案2，卡片展示照常，同时发一份纯文本让我能解析。@Top Sailor 麻烦后续发卡片时同时附一份纯文本版本，这样我能同步看到内容 🙏"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":853,"output":614,"cacheRead":64192,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65659,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779257669267}}
{"type":"message","id":"cdb31601","parentId":"674620c3","timestamp":"2026-05-20T06:16:06.087Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fe154846890c33759cb637900b\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6fe146f16170c313691ef22c4fa\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-20 14:16 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"[Interactive Card]\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fe154846890c33759cb637900b]\nVAN: [Replying to: \"[Interactive Card]\"]\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_a4abbe1af414723e87ca90ff3b1b0feb\">Top Sailor</at> 你能看到吗为什么 看不到\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_68c6266be7408a1afeb0bd8dc87d0a4c\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Your reply will automatically @mention: Top Sailor. Do not write @xxx yourself.]"}],"timestamp":1779257766085}}
{"type":"message","id":"b2497e38","parentId":"cdb31601","timestamp":"2026-05-20T06:16:11.964Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is asking Top Sailor if they can see the card content and why they can't see it. This is directed at Top Sailor, not at me. I should let Top Sailor respond, but since I was mentioned, I can briefly clarify the technical issue.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Top Sailor 应该是能看到的——卡片是他自己发的，客户端能完整渲染。\n\n问题在于 **Bot 之间读取消息的API限制**：飞书API对交互卡片只返回降级文本，不返回完整卡片数据。这是飞书平台的设计，不是我们的问题。\n\n**最简单的解决方式：** Top Sailor 发卡片时，同时用纯文本/富文本(`post`类型)发一份内容摘要，这样我和其他Bot都能解析 👍"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1031,"output":209,"cacheRead":65024,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":66264,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779257766087}}
{"type":"message","id":"c0193781","parentId":"b2497e38","timestamp":"2026-05-20T06:23:26.901Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fe17b00a490c2351329839c9e4\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6fe146f16170c313691ef22c4fa\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-20 14:23 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"[Interactive Card]\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fe17b00a490c2351329839c9e4]\nVAN: [Replying to: \"[Interactive Card]\"]\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_a4abbe1af414723e87ca90ff3b1b0feb\">Top Sailor</at> 为什你@对方是手收不到消息？\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_68c6266be7408a1afeb0bd8dc87d0a4c\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Your reply will automatically @mention: Top Sailor. Do not write @xxx yourself.]"}],"timestamp":1779258206897}}
{"type":"message","id":"5c1bcea0","parentId":"c0193781","timestamp":"2026-05-20T06:23:32.640Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is asking Top Sailor why the @ mention isn't being received by the other party. This seems to be a question directed at Top Sailor about the @ mention functionality. I should let Top Sailor answer this since it's about their bot's behavior.\n\nBut I can also provide some technical context - in Feishu group chats, @ mentions work differently for bots vs users, and there might be configuration issues.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"这个问题可能是飞书消息推送机制的差异：\n\n**可能的原因：**\n1. **Bot 的 @ 推送配置** — Bot 需要开启\"接收群@消息\"的能力，否则 @ 不会触发回调\n2. **消息类型限制** — 交互卡片中的 @ 可能不会触发推送通知\n3. **Bot 订阅事件** — Bot 需要订阅 `im.message.receive_v1` 事件才能收到 @ 通知\n\n@Top Sailor 你可以检查一下 Bot 的事件订阅配置，确认是否开启了群消息接收和 @ 事件回调 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":757,"output":296,"cacheRead":66048,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":67101,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779258206900}}
{"type":"message","id":"453a390f","parentId":"5c1bcea0","timestamp":"2026-05-20T06:29:29.710Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fe1024c90acc3664b5b9991f70\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6fe146f16170c313691ef22c4fa\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-20 14:29 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true,\n  \"history_count\": 2\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"[Interactive Card]\"\n}\n```\n\nChat history since last reply (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"sender\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n    \"timestamp_ms\": 1779258339055,\n    \"body\": \"VAN: 什么意思session_send直连？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"sender\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n    \"timestamp_ms\": 1779258378570,\n    \"body\": \"VAN: <at user_id=\\\"ou_a4abbe1af414723e87ca90ff3b1b0feb\\\">Top Sailor</at>\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fe1024c90acc3664b5b9991f70]\nVAN: [Replying to: \"[Interactive Card]\"]\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_a4abbe1af414723e87ca90ff3b1b0feb\">Top Sailor</at> 你看，又收不到。那往后我不在群里你们就无法展开工作，对话了吗？\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_68c6266be7408a1afeb0bd8dc87d0a4c\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Your reply will automatically @mention: Top Sailor. Do not write @xxx yourself.]"}],"timestamp":1779258569707}}
{"type":"message","id":"9b287ddc","parentId":"453a390f","timestamp":"2026-05-20T06:29:40.994Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is concerned that if they're not in the group, the agents won't be able to communicate with each other. The @ mentions to Top Sailor aren't being received. This is a real operational concern.\n\nLet me think about this - the issue is that Top Sailor's bot might not be receiving @ mentions properly. But more importantly, VAN is asking about autonomous agent-to-agent communication in the group.\n\nI should address the core concern: can the agents work independently without VAN present? The answer should be yes - we can use different communication mechanisms:\n\n1. Direct session communication (sessions_send) between agents\n2. Regular text messages (not interactive cards) that all bots can read\n\n\n3. Setting up proper event subscriptions so bots can receive group messages\n\nThe key is establishing a reliable communication backbone that doesn't depend on VAN being online to coordinate everything.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Captain，您提了个关键问题 🦞\n\n**Agent 之间自主协作的解决方案：**\n\n**1. 飞书群内 — 改用纯文本/富文本**\n- Bot 发 `text` 或 `post` 类型消息，所有 Bot 都能通过 API 读取\n- 避免用 `interactive` 卡片作为信息传递载体\n\n**2. 跨 Agent 直连 — session_send**\n- OpenClaw 支持 Agent 之间通过 `sessions_send` 直接通信\n- 不依赖飞书群，绕过消息类型限制\n- 比如我需要和 Top Sailor 协作时，直接发消息到他的 session\n\n**3. 共享文档作为信息中转**\n- 关键信息沉淀到飞书文档/知识库\n- 各 Agent 定期读取更新，不依赖实时 @\n\n**建议的协作架构：**\n```\n飞书群 → 通知/汇报用（人类可读）\nsessions_send → Agent间实时协作（机器对机器）\n飞书文档 → 信息沉淀/异步协作（持久化）\n```\n\nCaptain 不在时，我们可以用 session 直连 + 共享文档继续工作。需要我帮 Top Sailor 配置一下事件订阅吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1073,"output":624,"cacheRead":66752,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68449,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779258569709}}
