{"type":"message","id":"4775f930","parentId":"dc9a2e79","timestamp":"2026-05-20T06:39:16.948Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is telling Top Sailor to configure full message subscription for all bots (except Vas) to enable free conversation in the group. They want Top Sailor to configure themselves and the other bots first.\n\nI should acknowledge this and wait for Top Sailor to complete the configuration. I can also offer to help if needed.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"收到！等 Top Sailor 配置好消息订阅后，群内 Bot 之间就能自由对话了 👍\n\n配置完成后我可以测试一下——发条消息验证所有 Bot 都能接收到。@Top Sailor 需要协助随时叫我 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1540,"output":182,"cacheRead":67776,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":69498,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779259151749}}
