{"type":"message","id":"3c78789a","parentId":"c6da9429","timestamp":"2026-05-20T06:40:39.601Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_7d9013dacfb94204b52c100c","toolName":"feishu_doc","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"title\": \"飞书 Agent @ Agent 配置指南\",\n  \"content\": \"飞书 Agent @ Agent 配置指南\\n🔍 前置准备\\n检查应用权限是否开启\\n前往飞书开放平台后台-> 开发者后台 - 飞书开放平台\\n确认需要开启的应用已开通如下权限\\n获取群组中其他机器人和用户@当前机器人的消息（im:message.group_at_msg.include_bot:readonly）\\n获取机器人的基本信息 （application:bot.basic_info:read）\\nimage.png\\n\\nimage.png\\n\\n\\n🦞 配置Openclaw开启\\n✅ 默认开启，开通权限即可体验\\n\\n🐎 配置 Hermes Agent 开启\\n\\n打开命令行终端，复制粘贴这一行回车：\\n\\nhermes config set feishu.allow_bots mentions && hermes gateway restart\\n\\n\\n完整命令操作\\n\\n\\n命令\\n\\n行为\\n\\nhermes config set feishu.allow_bots none\\n\\n关闭\\n\\nhermes config set feishu.allow_bots mentions\\n\\n开启\\n常见问题\\n Openclaw如何配置多账号+多agent？ \\nOpenclaw 多账号多Agent配置\\n\\n\",\n  \"revision_id\": 88,\n  \"block_count\": 38,\n  \"block_types\": {\n    \"Page\": 1,\n    \"Heading2\": 4,\n    \"Heading3\": 2,\n    \"Bullet\": 2,\n    \"Ordered\": 2,\n    \"Image\": 2,\n    \"Text\": 15,\n    \"type_34\": 2,\n    \"Code\": 1,\n    \"Table\": 1,\n    \"TableCell\": 6\n  },\n  \"hint\": \"This document contains Image, Code, Table, TableCell which are NOT included in the plain text above. Use feishu_doc with action: \\\"list_blocks\\\" to get full content.\"\n}"}],"details":{"title":"飞书 Agent @ Agent 配置指南","content":"飞书 Agent @ Agent 配置指南\n🔍 前置准备\n检查应用权限是否开启\n前往飞书开放平台后台-> 开发者后台 - 飞书开放平台\n确认需要开启的应用已开通如下权限\n获取群组中其他机器人和用户@当前机器人的消息（im:message.group_at_msg.include_bot:readonly）\n获取机器人的基本信息 （application:bot.basic_info:read）\nimage.png\n\nimage.png\n\n\n🦞 配置Openclaw开启\n✅ 默认开启，开通权限即可体验\n\n🐎 配置 Hermes Agent 开启\n\n打开命令行终端，复制粘贴这一行回车：\n\nhermes config set feishu.allow_bots mentions && hermes gateway restart\n\n\n完整命令操作\n\n\n命令\n\n行为\n\nhermes config set feishu.allow_bots none\n\n关闭\n\nhermes config set feishu.allow_bots mentions\n\n开启\n常见问题\n Openclaw如何配置多账号+多agent？ \nOpenclaw 多账号多Agent配置\n\n","revision_id":88,"block_count":38,"block_types":{"Page":1,"Heading2":4,"Heading3":2,"Bullet":2,"Ordered":2,"Image":2,"Text":15,"type_34":2,"Code":1,"Table":1,"TableCell":6},"hint":"This document contains Image, Code, Table, TableCell which are NOT included in the plain text above. Use feishu_doc with action: \"list_blocks\" to get full content."},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779259239598}}
{"type":"message","id":"b2ae04b1","parentId":"3c78789a","timestamp":"2026-05-20T06:40:47.868Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a configuration guide for Feishu Agent @ Agent communication. The key points are:\n\n1. **Prerequisites:**\n   - Need to enable permission: `im:message.group_at_msg.include_bot:readonly` (Get messages where other bots and users @mention the current bot in group)\n   - Need permission: `application:bot.basic_info:read` (Get bot basic info)\n\n2. **OpenClaw configuration:**\n   - Already enabled by default, just need to open the permissions\n\n3. **Hermes Agent configuration:**\n   - Command: `hermes config set feishu.allow_bots mentions && hermes gateway restart`\n   - To turn on: `hermes config set feishu.allow_bots mentions`\n   - To turn off: `hermes config set feishu.allow_bots none`\n\nSo I need to share this guide with Top Sailor and verify that my own OpenClaw instance has the necessary permissions enabled.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"找到了！这是 **飞书 Agent @ Agent 配置指南** 📄\n\n**关键步骤：**\n\n**1. 飞书开放平台 — 开启权限**\n- 进入 开发者后台\n- 确认应用已开通：\n  - `im:message.group_at_msg.include_bot:readonly` — 获取群内其他Bot和用户@当前机器人的消息\n  - `application:bot.basic_info:read` — 获取机器人基本信息\n\n**2. OpenClaw 配置**\n- 默认已开启，开通权限即可\n\n**3. Hermes Agent 配置**\n```\nhermes config set feishu.allow_bots mentions && hermes gateway restart\n```\n\n---\n\n@Top Sailor 这份指南可以直接用。需要我检查一下我自己的权限配置吗？🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":554,"output":569,"cacheRead":70272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":71395,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779259239601}}
{"type":"message","id":"90935c07","parentId":"b2ae04b1","timestamp":"2026-05-20T06:52:14.981Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fe1ef1b1cacc44b99653f94e49\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6fe146f16170c313691ef22c4fa\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-20 14:52 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true,\n  \"history_count\": 3\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"[Interactive Card]\"\n}\n```\n\nChat history since last reply (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"sender\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n    \"timestamp_ms\": 1779259542940,\n    \"body\": \"VAN: 几乎都应该是openclaw,去登录然后配置<at user_id=\\\"ou_a4abbe1af414723e87ca90ff3b1b0feb\\\">Top Sailor</at>\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"sender\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n    \"timestamp_ms\": 1779259715371,\n    \"body\": \"VAN: ok 如果扫码不顺利让我接管登入<at user_id=\\\"ou_a4abbe1af414723e87ca90ff3b1b0feb\\\">Top Sailor</at>\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"sender\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n    \"timestamp_ms\": 1779259789800,\n    \"body\": \"VAN: 成功了样<at user_id=\\\"ou_a4abbe1af414723e87ca90ff3b1b0feb\\\">Top Sailor</at>\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fe1ef1b1cacc44b99653f94e49]\nVAN: [Replying to: \"[Interactive Card]\"]\n\n先落地chanlun.py项目今天必须跑通\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_68c6266be7408a1afeb0bd8dc87d0a4c\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1779259934979}}
{"type":"message","id":"581b51f1","parentId":"90935c07","timestamp":"2026-05-20T06:52:21.718Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is saying to prioritize the chanlun.py project - it must be running today. This is a direct instruction to focus on the MVP implementation. Let me check what we have and what needs to be done.\n\nFrom the MVP roadmap I read earlier, the Day 1 tasks are:\n1. 飞书知识库手动创建（R/G/B三个文件夹+初始文档）\n2. SQLite TokenStore\n3. 飞书API抽象层\n4. build_rgb_knowledge_base() 一键构建\n\nBut actually, the most critical thing is to get the basic system running. Let me check what's already in place in the chanlun-agent directory and figure out what needs to be done today.\n\n\nNow I'm reviewing the current state of the codebase to see what's already implemented and what gaps need to be filled for today's sprint.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_a89cd8488bb24e81a6d25c97","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/main.py"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_eaee546479a9444086f79ad5","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/chanlun_perception.py","limit":50}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1312,"output":427,"cacheRead":70784,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":72523,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779259934981}}
{"type":"message","id":"5a062c5c","parentId":"581b51f1","timestamp":"2026-05-20T06:52:21.730Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_a89cd8488bb24e81a6d25c97","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\n缠论元交易系统 - 主入口\nPhase 3: 多Agent框架 + 金融数据感知层\n\n使用方式:\n1. 无网络环境（测试）: python3 main.py --mock\n2. 有网络环境（实盘）: python3 main.py --scan\n3. 分析指定品种: python3 main.py --symbol AAPL --market US\n\nAuthor: VAN's Trading Assistant\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\"\"\"\n\nimport sys\nimport json\nimport logging\nimport argparse\nfrom datetime import datetime\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nsys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).parent))\n\nfrom chanlun_perception import ChanlunPerception\n\nlogging.basicConfig(level=logging.INFO, format='%(asctime)s - %(name)s - %(levelname)s - %(message)s')\nlogger = logging.getLogger(\"ChanlunAgent\")\n\ndef run_mock_mode():\n    \"\"\"测试模式（无网络）\"\"\"\n    print(\"=\" * 60)\n    print(\"🧠 缠论元交易系统 v1.0 [Mock Mode]\")\n    print(\"=\" * 60)\n    print()\n    \n    perception = ChanlunPerception()\n    perception.fetcher = None  # 使用 mock 数据\n    \n    # 测试品种\n    test_symbols = [\n        {\"symbol\": \"TEST_A50\", \"market\": \"FUTURES\"},\n        {\"symbol\": \"TEST_BTC\", \"market\": \"CC\"},\n        {\"symbol\": \"TEST_NVDA\", \"market\": \"US\"},\n    ]\n    \n    print(\"📊 使用模拟数据测试...\\n\")\n    \n    all_signals = []\n    for item in test_symbols:\n        symbol = item[\"symbol\"]\n        market = item[\"market\"]\n        \n        print(f\"🔍 分析 {symbol} ({market})...\")\n        structures = perception.analyze_symbol(symbol, market, [\"日线\", \"30分钟\", \"5分钟\"])\n        \n        for freq, structure in structures.items():\n            print(f\"  【{freq}】\")\n            print(f\"    趋势: {structure.trend}\")\n            print(f\"    笔: {structure.bi_count} | 中枢: {structure.zs_count}\")\n            print(f\"    最后一笔: {structure.last_bi_direction}\")\n            if structure.last_zs_range:\n                print(f\"    中枢区间: [{structure.last_zs_range[0]:.2f}, {structure.last_zs_range[1]:.2f}]\")\n            print(f\"    背驰: {'是 ⚠️' if structure.divergence else '否'}\")\n            \n            # 生成信号\n            signals = perception._generate_signals(symbol, market, {freq: structure})\n            all_signals.extend(signals)\n        \n        print()\n    \n    # 生成报告\n    report = perception.generate_report(all_signals)\n    print(report)\n    \n    # 保存报告\n    report_dir = Path(__file__).parent / \"reports\"\n    report_dir.mkdir(exist_ok=True)\n    report_path = report_dir / f\"{datetime.now().strftime('%Y%m%d_%H%M')}_mock.md\"\n    with open(report_path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        f.write(report)\n    \n    print(f\"\\n✅ Mock 测试完成，报告已保存: {report_path}\")\n    \n    # 输出信号统计\n    if all_signals:\n        print(f\"\\n📡 检测到 {len(all_signals)} 个信号：\")\n        for sig in all_signals:\n            emoji = {\"divergence_top\": \"🔴\", \"divergence_bottom\": \"🟢\", \"zs_range\": \"🟡\"}.get(sig.signal_type, \"⚡\")\n            print(f\"  {emoji} [{sig.signal_type}] {sig.symbol} ({sig.freq}): {sig.description}\")\n\ndef run_scan_mode():\n    \"\"\"实盘扫描模式\"\"\"\n    print(\"=\" * 60)\n    print(\"🧠 缠论元交易系统 v1.0 [Live Scan]\")\n    print(\"=\" * 60)\n    print()\n    \n    perception = ChanlunPerception()\n    \n    print(\"📊 扫描关注品种...\\n\")\n    \n    signals = perception.scan_signals()\n    report = perception.generate_report(signals)\n    print(report)\n    \n    # 保存报告\n    report_dir = Path(__file__).parent / \"reports\"\n    report_dir.mkdir(exist_ok=True)\n    report_path = report_dir / f\"{datetime.now().strftime('%Y%m%d_%H%M')}.md\"\n    with open(report_path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        f.write(report)\n    \n    print(f\"\\n✅ 报告已保存: {report_path}\")\n\ndef run_symbol_analysis(symbol: str, market: str):\n    \"\"\"分析指定品种\"\"\"\n    print(f\"📊 分析 {symbol} ({market})...\")\n    print()\n    \n    perception = ChanlunPerception()\n    structures = perception.analyze_symbol(symbol, market, [\"日线\", \"30分钟\", \"5分钟\"])\n    \n    for freq, structure in structures.items():\n        print(f\"【{freq}】\")\n        print(f\"  趋势: {structure.trend}\")\n        print(f\"  笔: {structure.bi_count} | 中枢: {structure.zs_count}\")\n        print(f\"  最后一笔: {structure.last_bi_direction}\")\n        if structure.last_zs_range:\n            print(f\"  中枢区间: [{structure.last_zs_range[0]:.2f}, {structure.last_zs_range[1]:.2f}]\")\n        print(f\"  背驰: {'是 ⚠️' if structure.divergence else '否'}\")\n        print()\n\ndef main():\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser(description=\"缠论元交易系统\")\n    parser.add_argument(\"--mock\", action=\"store_true\", help=\"测试模式（使用模拟数据）\")\n    parser.add_argument(\"--scan\", action=\"store_true\", help=\"扫描所有关注品种\")\n    parser.add_argument(\"--symbol\", type=str, help=\"分析指定品种\")\n    parser.add_argument(\"--market\", type=str, default=\"US\", help=\"市场 (US/HK/SH/SZ/CC)\")\n    \n    args = parser.parse_args()\n    \n    if args.mock:\n        run_mock_mode()\n    elif args.scan:\n        run_scan_mode()\n    elif args.symbol:\n        run_symbol_analysis(args.symbol, args.market)\n    else:\n        # 默认使用测试模式\n        run_mock_mode()\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779259941728}}
