{"type":"message","id":"ff507ac0","parentId":"e3ca8647","timestamp":"2026-05-20T07:10:33.646Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me create the G-指南库 content for the signal execution SOP and risk control guide.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_93389b889d76499fb52e72d6","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# 四级信号执行 SOP\n\n## 信号分级定义\n\n| 级别 | 名称 | 条件 | 仓位建议 | 动作 |\n|------|------|------|----------|------|\n| L1 | 预警 | 单一级别背驰 | 空仓观望 | 记录信号，等待确认 |\n| L2 | 准备 | 两级共振背驰 | 10-20% 仓位 | 准备下单，等分型确认 |\n| L3 | 行动 | 三级共振 + 分型确认 | 30-50% 仓位 | 执行入场 |\n| L4 | 重仓 | 三级共振 + 放量突破 | 50-80% 仓位 | 加仓/满仓 |\n\n## 执行流程\n\n### L1 预警\n1. 检测到单一级别（如5分钟）背驰\n2. 记录到信号日志\n3. 等待更高级别确认\n\n### L2 准备\n1. 两个级别同时出现背驰信号\n2. 准备下单参数（价格、数量、止损位）\n3. 等待分型确认\n\n### L3 行动\n1. 三个级别（5分钟 + 30分钟 + 日线）共振\n2. 分型已确认\n3. 执行下单\n4. 设置止损（技术止损 + 时间止损）\n\n### L4 重仓\n1. 三级共振 + 成交量放大\n2. 加仓至目标仓位\n3. 移动止损保护利润\n\n## 止损设置\n\n| 止损类型 | 触发条件 | 动作 |\n|----------|----------|------|\n| 技术止损 | 价格跌回中枢内 | 全部平仓 |\n| 时间止损 | N根K线未达预期 | 减仓50% |\n| 资金止损 | 单笔亏损 > 3% | 全部平仓 |\n| 日止损 | 当日累计亏损 > 8% | 停止交易 |\n","file_path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/G-guides/signal_sop.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":555,"output":545,"cacheRead":101760,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":102860,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779261016572}}
{"type":"message","id":"20795a21","parentId":"ff507ac0","timestamp":"2026-05-20T07:10:33.652Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_93389b889d76499fb52e72d6","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully wrote 691 bytes to /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/G-guides/signal_sop.md"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779261033650}}
{"type":"message","id":"21a0c2b7","parentId":"20795a21","timestamp":"2026-05-20T07:10:46.201Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me also create the B-最佳实践库 content.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7c4c4499fdab445e9f75d537","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# 交易反思模板\n\n## 反思结构\n\n每次交易完成后自动生成以下结构化反思：\n\n### 1. 结构分析\n- 当时的缠论结构（笔/中枢/背驰状态）\n- 多级别联立情况\n- 分型确认情况\n\n### 2. 决策回顾\n- 入场/出场理由\n- 仓位大小是否合理\n- 止损设置是否恰当\n\n### 3. 归因分析\n- 盈利/亏损的主要原因\n- 是技术分析准确还是运气成分\n- 市场环境因素\n\n### 4. 改进措施\n- 下次类似情况如何处理\n- 参数是否需要调整\n- 策略是否需要优化\n\n## 记录格式\n\n```markdown\n## [日期] [品种] [方向] [盈亏%]\n\n### 结构\n- 日线趋势: [up/down/neutral]\n- 5分钟信号: [bi_buy/bi_sell/zs_buy/zs_sell]\n- 中枢位置: [中枢上方/中枢内/中枢下方]\n\n### 决策\n- 入场价: $XXX | 出场价: $XXX\n- 仓位: XX% | 止损: $XXX\n- 信号级别: [L1/L2/L3/L4]\n\n### 归因\n- [盈亏主要原因]\n\n### 改进\n- [下次改进措施]\n```\n\n## 自动追加规则\n\n- 每次平仓后5分钟内自动生成反思\n- 连续3笔亏损时触发深度反思\n- 每周日生成周度反思汇总\n","file_path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/B-practices/reflection_template.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":608,"output":423,"cacheRead":102272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":103303,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779261033654}}
