{"type":"message","id":"89042257","parentId":"709908b8","timestamp":"2026-05-20T07:11:14.079Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Let me give a clear summary to Captain of what's been completed and what's next.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**MVP Day 1 实际落地完成 🦞**\n\n```\nchanlun-agent/\n├── ChanlunAgent.py         ✅ Agent核心（8个飞书指令）\n├── store.py                ✅ SQLite持久化（交易/信号/反思）\n├── config.py               ✅ 配置中心（外部化参数）\n├── config/\n│   └── agent_config.json   ✅ 默认配置\n├── knowledge/              ✅ RGB知识库初始内容\n│   ├── R-rules/            笔/中枢精确规则\n│   ├── G-guides/           信号执行SOP\n│   └── B-practices/        反思模板\n├── data/finance_fetcher/   ✅ iTick bug已修复\n└── paper-trading/          ✅ CRCL监控可用\n```\n\n**已可运行：**\n- `python3 ChanlunAgent.py --demo` → 全指令演示\n- `python3 crcl_monitor.py --once` → CRCL实时分析\n- `python3 main.py --mock` → 缠论引擎测试\n\n**待飞书凭证配置后即可接入群聊。**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":555,"output":294,"cacheRead":103552,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":104401,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779261064683}}
{"type":"message","id":"8f3b92e1","parentId":"89042257","timestamp":"2026-05-20T07:16:32.746Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fe1b2242084c4ce8a4da194e00\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6fe146f16170c313691ef22c4fa\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-20 15:16 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"[Interactive Card]\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fe1b2242084c4ce8a4da194e00]\nVAN: [Replying to: \"[Interactive Card]\"]\n\n怎样配置飞书凭证？\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_68c6266be7408a1afeb0bd8dc87d0a4c\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1779261392742}}
{"type":"message","id":"4da160a7","parentId":"8f3b92e1","timestamp":"2026-05-20T07:16:54.042Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is asking how to configure Feishu credentials for the ChanlunAgent. I should provide clear instructions on how to set up the Feishu app credentials.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**飞书凭证配置步骤：** 🦞\n\n**1. 创建飞书应用**\n- 打开 [飞书开放平台](https://open.feishu.cn/app)\n- 点击「创建企业自建应用」\n- 填写应用名称（如 \"ChanlunAgent\"）\n\n**2. 获取凭证**\n- 进入应用 → 「凭证与基础信息」\n- 复制 **App ID** 和 **App Secret**\n\n**3. 开通权限**\n- 进入「权限管理」\n- 搜索并开通：\n  - `im:message.group_at_msg.include_bot:readonly` — 接收群@消息\n  - `application:bot.basic_info:read` — 机器人基本信息\n  - `im:message` — 发送消息\n\n**4. 配置到系统**\n\n方式一：直接写入配置文件\n```bash\nvi chanlun-agent/config/agent_config.json\n```\n修改：\n```json\n{\n  \"feishu\": {\n    \"app_id\": \"cli_xxxxx\",\n    \"app_secret\": \"xxxxx\",\n    \"chat_id\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n方式二：环境变量\n```bash\nexport FEISHU_APP_ID=cli_xxxxx\nexport FEISHU_APP_SECRET=xxxxx\nexport FEISHU_CHAT_ID=oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\n```\n\n**5. 启用机器人**\n- 飞书开放平台 → 「应用发布」→ 创建版本 → 审核通过\n- 将机器人添加到群聊\n\n---\n\n配置好后告诉我 App ID 和 App Secret，我来接入测试 👍"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":845,"output":481,"cacheRead":104064,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":105390,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779261392745}}
{"type":"message","id":"b3458f9f","parentId":"4da160a7","timestamp":"2026-05-20T07:18:34.416Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fe24a42ace0c4a885af6917948\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6fe146f16170c313691ef22c4fa\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-20 15:18 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"[Interactive Card]\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fe24a42ace0c4a885af6917948]\nVAN: [Replying to: \"[Interactive Card]\"]\n\n你的意思是新建一个bot？（agent（agent\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_68c6266be7408a1afeb0bd8dc87d0a4c\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1779261514412}}
{"type":"message","id":"108df7c2","parentId":"b3458f9f","timestamp":"2026-05-20T07:18:44.571Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is asking if I mean to create a new bot/agent. Actually, looking at this more carefully - we already have an OpenClaw bot running in this group. The ChanlunAgent could either:\n\n1. Use the existing OpenClaw bot's credentials\n2. Create a separate dedicated bot\n\nLet me think about this... The existing bot (my bot) is already connected to OpenClaw. The ChanlunAgent is a separate Python application. \n\nActually, the better approach might be to integrate ChanlunAgent as a skill/tool within the existing OpenClaw setup, rather than creating a separate bot. That way it can use the existing Feishu credentials and be invoked through the existing bot.\n\n\nI should clarify this for VAN - we don't need a separate bot at all. The ChanlunAgent can hook into the existing OpenClaw bot's credentials and get invoked directly through it, which is much simpler than spinning up another bot.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"不用新建！可以直接用现有的 OpenClaw Bot 凭证。\n\n**两种方案：**\n\n**方案A：复用现有 Bot（推荐）**\n- 我当前运行的 OpenClaw Bot 已有飞书凭证\n- ChanlunAgent 作为 OpenClaw 的一个 Skill/工具接入\n- 通过 `@我 分析 CRCL` 这种方式调用，不需要新 Bot\n\n**方案B：独立 Bot**\n- 新建一个专门的 ChanlunAgent Bot\n- 需要单独维护凭证和部署\n\n---\n\n**方案A 更简单** — 我可以把 ChanlunAgent 集成为 OpenClaw 的一个 Skill，直接在现有 Bot 上调用缠论分析，不用额外部署。\n\nCaptain 偏好哪种？如果选 A，我现在就可以集成进去 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":990,"output":575,"cacheRead":104896,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":106461,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779261514415}}
{"type":"message","id":"64b4e273","parentId":"108df7c2","timestamp":"2026-05-20T07:21:32.066Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fe24167b48cc29dc4afddb03cd\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6fe146f16170c313691ef22c4fa\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-20 15:21 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true,\n  \"history_count\": 2\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"[Interactive Card]\"\n}\n```\n\nChat history since last reply (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"sender\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n    \"timestamp_ms\": 1779261605923,\n    \"body\": \"VAN: 还是没有看到云电脑开启，<at user_id=\\\"ou_a4abbe1af414723e87ca90ff3b1b0feb\\\">Top Sailor</at>\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"sender\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n    \"timestamp_ms\": 1779261656615,\n    \"body\": \"VAN: a\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fe24167b48cc29dc4afddb03cd]\nVAN: [Replying to: \"[Interactive Card]\"]\n\nA\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_68c6266be7408a1afeb0bd8dc87d0a4c\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1779261692062}}
{"type":"message","id":"0a04c995","parentId":"64b4e273","timestamp":"2026-05-20T07:21:39.411Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN chose Option A - integrate ChanlunAgent as a Skill within the existing OpenClaw bot. Let me do this now.\n\nI need to create a ChanlunAgent skill that can be invoked through OpenClaw. This means creating a SKILL.md file and making the ChanlunAgent code accessible as a skill.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_424e463694ad4ace939b3d4a","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/skill-creator/SKILL.md","limit":50}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1133,"output":184,"cacheRead":105856,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":107173,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779261692065}}
{"type":"message","id":"66b13ac5","parentId":"0a04c995","timestamp":"2026-05-20T07:21:39.419Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_424e463694ad4ace939b3d4a","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: skill-creator\ndescription: Create, edit, improve, or audit AgentSkills. Use when creating a new skill from scratch or when asked to improve, review, audit, tidy up, or clean up an existing skill or SKILL.md file. Also use when editing or restructuring a skill directory (moving files to references/ or scripts/, removing stale content, validating against the AgentSkills spec). Triggers on phrases like \"create a skill\", \"author a skill\", \"tidy up a skill\", \"improve this skill\", \"review the skill\", \"clean up the skill\", \"audit the skill\".\n---\n\n# Skill Creator\n\nThis skill provides guidance for creating effective skills.\n\n## About Skills\n\nSkills are modular, self-contained packages that extend Codex's capabilities by providing\nspecialized knowledge, workflows, and tools. Think of them as \"onboarding guides\" for specific\ndomains or tasks—they transform Codex from a general-purpose agent into a specialized agent\nequipped with procedural knowledge that no model can fully possess.\n\n### What Skills Provide\n\n1. Specialized workflows - Multi-step procedures for specific domains\n2. Tool integrations - Instructions for working with specific file formats or APIs\n3. Domain expertise - Company-specific knowledge, schemas, business logic\n4. Bundled resources - Scripts, references, and assets for complex and repetitive tasks\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### Concise is Key\n\nThe context window is a public good. Skills share the context window with everything else Codex needs: system prompt, conversation history, other Skills' metadata, and the actual user request.\n\n**Default assumption: Codex is already very smart.** Only add context Codex doesn't already have. Challenge each piece of information: \"Does Codex really need this explanation?\" and \"Does this paragraph justify its token cost?\"\n\nPrefer concise examples over verbose explanations.\n\n### Set Appropriate Degrees of Freedom\n\nMatch the level of specificity to the task's fragility and variability:\n\n**High freedom (text-based instructions)**: Use when multiple approaches are valid, decisions depend on context, or heuristics guide the approach.\n\n**Medium freedom (pseudocode or scripts with parameters)**: Use when a preferred pattern exists, some variation is acceptable, or configuration affects behavior.\n\n**Low freedom (specific scripts, few parameters)**: Use when operations are fragile and error-prone, consistency is critical, or a specific sequence must be followed.\n\nThink of Codex as exploring a path: a narrow bridge with cliffs needs specific guardrails (low freedom), while an open field allows many routes (high freedom).\n\n### Anatomy of a Skill\n\nEvery skill consists of a required SKILL.md file and optional bundled resources:\n\n```\n\n[323 more lines in file. Use offset=51 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779261699416}}
