{"type":"message","id":"3b8949d3","parentId":"4b4c04de","timestamp":"2026-05-20T07:28:58.568Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I need to append to this file. Let me add the new memories from today's session.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f8d90e3354ca4b0b8729fa6f","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat >> /workspace/projects/workspace/memory/2026-05-20.md << 'EOF'\n\n### 15:28 - 飞书群协作 & ChanlunAgent MVP Day 1 完成\n\n**飞书群动态：**\n- Captain (VAN) 建立了飞书群，成员包括：Trading Assistant (我)、Top Sailor、Vas、Nova、Linda\n- Top Sailor 任 COO/群管理\n- 讨论了飞书群协作机制：主动发言、CONTACT.md 动态维护、共享文档中转\n- Captain 要求遵循 Superpowers AI 编程流程（先理清需求→拆分任务→先写测试→编码→自查）\n- 发现飞书交互卡片(Interactive Card)的API限制：Bot只能看到fallback文本，看不到完整卡片内容\n- 解决方案：改用纯文本/富文本(post)传递信息，或用 sessions_send 直连\n\n**飞书 Agent @ Agent 配置：**\n- 文档位置：https://bytedance.larkoffice.com/wiki/GtniwsJOzirrBEkmDFGcswmMnQg\n- 需开启权限：`im:message.group_at_msg.include_bot:readonly`\n- OpenClaw 默认已开启，Hermes 需手动配置：`hermes config set feishu.allow_bots mentions`\n\n**ChanlunAgent MVP 路线图（Captain分享）：**\n- 30天落地计划：基础设施→信号质量→风控→自进化闭环\n- RGB知识库架构：R-规则库/G-指南库/B-最佳实践库\n- 飞书全闭环：@Agent 持仓/分析/信号/平仓/反思/日报\n- 文件位置：通过飞书API下载保存\n\n**MVP Day 1 实际完成：**\n1. ✅ **iTick bug 修复** — Python Enum 将 `ITICK_MAP = {...}` 当作枚举成员，改为模块级常量 `ITICK_KLINE_MAP`\n2. ✅ **SQLite TokenStore** (`store.py`) — 交易记录/信号日志/反思记录/Token持久化\n3. ✅ **配置中心** (`config.py`) — 外部化参数，支持JSON配置文件\n4. ✅ **ChanlunAgent 核心** (`ChanlunAgent.py`) — 8个指令全部可用（持仓/分析/信号/平仓/反思/日报/状态/帮助）\n5. ✅ **RGB知识库初始内容** — 笔/中枢规则、信号执行SOP、反思模板\n6. ✅ **集成到 OpenClaw Skill** — 不需要新建Bot，通过现有Bot调用\n\n**项目结构：**\n```\nchanlun-agent/\n├── ChanlunAgent.py     # Agent核心（飞书交互）\n├── store.py            # SQLite持久化\n├── config.py           # 配置中心\n├── config/             # 配置文件\n├── knowledge/          # RGB知识库\n├── data/               # czsc + FinanceFetcher\n├── paper-trading/      # CRCL模拟交易\n├── reports/            # 分析报告\n└── skills/chanlun-agent/ # OpenClaw Skil