{"type":"message","id":"677c5109","parentId":"24f17075","timestamp":"2026-05-20T07:31:21.578Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is saying \"继续\" (continue). They want me to keep working on the MVP. Let me check what the next actionable items are.\n\nFrom the MVP roadmap, the next steps after Day 1 are:\n- Day 2-3: Feishu knowledge base R/G/B setup, OpenClaw RAG config\n- Day 4-5: Signal quality improvement (类二买/中枢震荡)\n- Day 6-7: Risk control engine\n\nBut wait - VAN also mentioned wanting to connect to the cloud computer through Feishu. Let me check what Top Sailor was supposed to help with. It seems like VAN wants to be able to access/control the cloud computer (where OpenClaw runs) through Feishu.\n \nLooking at the chat history, VAN is asking how to access the cloud computer from Feishu - they mentioned Linda showed them a \"接管\" (takeover) link before. Since I don't have direct knowledge of this OpenClaw feature, I should continue with the MVP work while also investigating how to set up this remote access capability.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"继续推进 MVP。让我检查下一步可落地的内容："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_65e02960a6b44aa68170e373","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent && python3 -c \"\nfrom chanlun_perception import ChanlunPerception\nimport czsc\n\n# 测试类二买 API 可用性\nka = czsc.CZSC([])\nprint('CZSC methods:', [m for m in dir(ka) if not m.startswith('_')])\nprint()\n\n# 检查是否有 zs_list, bi_list\nprint('Has bi_list:', hasattr(ka, 'bi_list'))\nprint('Has zs_list:', hasattr(ka, 'zs_list'))\nprint('Has fx_list:', hasattr(ka, 'fx_list'))\n\" 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":34306,"output":615,"cacheRead":28672,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":63593,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779262271326}}
