{"type":"message","id":"675d4af8","parentId":"859f056d","timestamp":"2026-05-20T07:40:38.522Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me give a comprehensive summary to Captain.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**今日 MVP 进度汇总：** 🦞\n\n```\nchanlun-agent/\n├── ChanlunAgent.py      ✅ Agent核心（8指令+风控集成）\n├── czsc_extension.py    ✅ 类二买/中枢震荡/背驰检测\n├── risk_engine.py       ✅ 三级风控（技术/时间/资金/熔断）\n├── store.py             ✅ SQLite持久化\n├── config.py            ✅ 配置中心\n├── chanlun_perception.py ✅ 缠论感知层\n├── config/              ✅ 默认配置\n├── knowledge/           ✅ RGB知识库初始\n├── data/                ✅ iTick修复+FinanceFetcher\n└── paper-trading/       ✅ CRCL监控\n```\n\n**已实现功能：**\n- ✅ 缠论分析（笔/中枢/趋势/背驰）\n- ✅ 类二买/中枢震荡买卖点检测\n- ✅ 三级风控（技术止损/时间止损/资金止损/熔断）\n- ✅ 固定风险比例仓位计算（3%风险，50%最大仓位）\n- ✅ SQLite持久化（交易/信号/反思）\n- ✅ 飞书8个交互指令\n- ✅ 集成到OpenClaw Skill\n\n**待配置：** 飞书App凭证 → 群内@Agent直接调用"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":451,"output":328,"cacheRead":79552,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":80331,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779262817016}}
