{"type":"message","id":"46e31346","parentId":"fc8beef0","timestamp":"2026-05-20T07:44:02.985Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can map our progress. Let me also check what we've done from Week 2 and Week 3.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**对照 MVP 路线图，当前进度：** 🦞\n\n| 阶段 | 任务 | 状态 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **Week 1** | | |\n| Day 1 | 飞书知识库创建（R/G/B） | ✅ 本地结构+初始内容已建 |\n| Day 2 | SQLite TokenStore + 飞书API抽象层 | ✅ 全部完成 |\n| Day 3 | `build_rgb_knowledge_base()` | ⏳ 本地文件已有，需同步飞书 |\n| Day 4 | 基础飞书消息响应（持仓/分析/帮助） | ✅ 8个指令可用 |\n| Day 5 | OpenClaw RAG 配置 | ❌ 待配置 |\n| Day 6 | RAG 问答测试 | ❌ 待配置 |\n| Day 7 | 缓冲日 | - |\n| **Week 2** | | |\n| Day 8 | spike test（czsc类二买验证） | ✅ czsc_extension.py 已实现 |\n| Day 9-14 | 类二买/中枢震荡/背驰增强 | ✅ 核心逻辑已实现 |\n| **Week 3** | | |\n| Day 15-21 | 风控体系 | ✅ 三级风控+仓位计算已实现 |\n\n**总结：Week 1 Day 1-4 ✅ + Week 2 核心 ✅ + Week 3 核心 ✅**\n\n**待完成：**\n- 飞书知识库同步到线上（需飞书凭证）\n- OpenClaw RAG 配置\n- 飞书 App 凭证配置（群内@Agent响应）"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":554,"output":431,"cacheRead":81536,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":82521,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779263032310}}
